OL,3,AHousehold energy bills forecast to see
OL,4,Abiggest rise in four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHousehold energy prices are set to soar
OL,7,Fin January, with a typical annual bill
OL,8,Fforecast to jump by #276, figures
OL,9,Fshared with the BBC reveal.
OL,11,FThe 16% predicted increase would hit
OL,12,Fmillions of households at the coldest
OL,13,Ftime of year, and would mark the
OL,14,Fbiggest rise in bills for four years.
OL,16,FThe forecast from consultancy Cornwall
OL,17,FInsight comes a day before prices go up
OL,18,Funder regulator Ofgem's October price
OL,19,Fcap and puts increased pressure on the
OL,20,Fgovernment to support those who will
OL,21,Fstruggle to pay.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
