OL,3,AHousehold energy bills forecast to see
OL,4,Abiggest rise in four years
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the boss of supplier EDF
OL,7,FSimone Rossi has warned the UK is
OL,8,F"walking into a second energy crisis"
OL,9,Fand called for an extension to the VAT
OL,10,Fcut on electricity which kicks in on
OL,11,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
