OL,3,ABurnham vows to end existing pension
OL,4,Atriple lock in 2030 to help fund care
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has set out his plan to
OL,7,Ftransform Britain, including by ending
OL,8,Fthe existing state pension triple lock
OL,9,Ffrom 2030 to help fund a new national
OL,10,Fcare service.
OL,12,FIn his first Labour Party conference
OL,13,Fspeech as prime minister, Burnham also
OL,14,Fsaid he wants to pave the way for
OL,15,Fgreater public control over housing,
OL,16,Fwater and energy services, and
OL,17,Fpotentially reform the UK's electoral
OL,18,Fsystem.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
