OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham vows to end existing pension
OL,4,Atriple lock in 2030 to help fund care
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter days of questions over how to
OL,7,Ffund his social care reforms in
OL,8,FEngland, Burnham pointed to changing
OL,9,Fthe triple lock to generate
OL,10,F"significant savings".
OL,12,FHis plans would see the state pension
OL,13,Fincrease every year at least by
OL,14,Finflation or 2.5% - but remove the
OL,15,Fautomatic annual link with average
OL,16,Fearnings.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
