OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASouth Korea demands apology from
OL,4,APyongyang for landmine blasts that
OL,5,Ainjured three
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Korea said on Tuesday that the
OL,8,Fblasts, which happened on South Korea's
OL,9,Fside of the DMZ, were "highly likely"
OL,10,Ffrom North Korean mines. It vowed to
OL,11,Ftake "corresponding measures" for what
OL,12,Fit said was a violation of a
OL,13,Fdecades-old armistice.
OL,15,FNorth Korea has denied responsibility
OL,16,Ffor the blasts, calling Seoul's claims
OL,17,F"groundless" and a "farce" to escalate
OL,18,Ftensions on the peninsula.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
